			"Message": "docs(Worker): Expand README architecture diagram with Sky integration\n\nReplace the abstract service worker Mermaid diagram with a detailed architecture visualization showing the full Sky-Worker interaction flow. The new diagram documents the Astro page (Sky) registering the service worker, the CSS loading strategy via Worker/CSS/Load.ts, and the dual-cache policy (CACHE_CORE network-first for navigation, CACHE_ASSET cache-first for static assets).\n\nThis provides new contributors with a clear map of how Sky pages load JS modules and CSS through the Service Worker interception layer.",
